DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/brand-protection/domain/queries/{query_id}
Delete a saved brand protection domain query from the account_queries table. This operation will remove the query from the durable object database. Returns 404 if the query ID doesn't exist.
Required: account_id (path); query_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/brand-protection/logo/queries/{query_id}
Delete a saved brand protection logo query. Returns 404 if the query ID doesn't exist.
Required: account_id (path); query_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/brand-protection/letter/templates/{template_id}
Delete a user-defined takedown letter template. System templates cannot be deleted.
Required: account_id (path); template_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/brand-protection/takedown-notices/{notice_id}/letters/{letter_id}
Delete a specific takedown letter and its associated PDF from storage.
Required: account_id (path); notice_id (path); letter_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/brand-protection/takedown-notices/{notice_id}
Delete a takedown notice and all associated letters. PDFs are also removed from storage.
Required: account_id (path); notice_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/brand-protection/letter/templates/{template_id}
Get a specific user-defined takedown letter template by ID. System example templates are available via the /templates/examples endpoint.
Required: account_id (path); template_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/brand-protection/takedown-notices/{notice_id}/letters/{letter_id}
Get a specific takedown letter by ID, including the rendered text.
Required: account_id (path); notice_id (path); letter_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/v2/brand-protection/takedown-notices/{notice_id}
Get a specific takedown notice by ID.
Required: account_id (path); notice_id (path)
